From: "keepup[bot]" <keepup[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] fix(examples): move the anthropic example to
 claude-sonnet-5-5

Anthropic launched Claude Sonnet 5.5 on 28 Sep 2026, so the minimal
Anthropic example follows it. Sonnet 5.5 returns a 400 error for forced
tool use (tool_choice any or tool). AURA's crates never set tool_choice,
and in the rig fork the only forced tool use is its Extractor, which
AURA never builds, so this example isn't affected.

Replay date: 2026-09-28.
Source: Claude Platform release notes,
https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/release-notes/overview
---
 examples/minimal/anthropic.toml | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/examples/minimal/anthropic.toml b/examples/minimal/anthropic.toml
index 4efff7fe..1e9afd34 100644
--- a/examples/minimal/anthropic.toml
+++ b/examples/minimal/anthropic.toml
@@ -11,5 +11,5 @@ system_prompt = "You are a helpful assistant."
 [agent.llm]
 provider = "anthropic"
 api_key = "{{ env.ANTHROPIC_API_KEY }}"
-model = "claude-sonnet-5"
+model = "claude-sonnet-5-5"
 
